    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/c9ffa0934243e1e5dc85e623b2cce687.avif?t=1748151406\" data-has-big width=800 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is an FPS game that races over a western train and takes on a gang eroded by an unknown presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run over the western train!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/b4eba1e2e1212741e55249557d9371cd.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/b4eba1e2e1212741e55249557d9371cd.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/b4eba1e2e1212741e55249557d9371cd.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a Western-era outlaw, deal with a gang that's occupying the train.<br>Will you be able to get to the end of the train safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take away the enemy's weapons!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/64eb61270b932a7779f08e86a3512f26.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/64eb61270b932a7779f08e86a3512f26.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/64eb61270b932a7779f08e86a3512f26.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly bring the weapon that the enemy drops with the chain.<br>The weapon you brought is free to use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/83e06bf1e4c6fc4370365ac55a1119a9.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/83e06bf1e4c6fc4370365ac55a1119a9.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/83e06bf1e4c6fc4370365ac55a1119a9.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/09c8f7e86514b1ebd1e53e5fc49899e7.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/09c8f7e86514b1ebd1e53e5fc49899e7.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/09c8f7e86514b1ebd1e53e5fc49899e7.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/2edb265a2012a418ae9423ea5a31bc59.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/2edb265a2012a418ae9423ea5a31bc59.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/2edb265a2012a418ae9423ea5a31bc59.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try a total of seven distinctive weapons.<br>You'll be able to run the train more easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the unknown!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/14a7bf834632bc4918b3401a70b3ab29.poster.avif?t=1748151406\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/14a7bf834632bc4918b3401a70b3ab29.webm?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/14a7bf834632bc4918b3401a70b3ab29.mp4?t=1748151406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gang devoured by the unknown and into madness appears...<br>Fall into the occult elements of only!</p>",
